---

<a href="/about" class="featured-banner">
  <div class="banner-art">KP</div>
  <div class="banner-content">
    <p class="banner-label">Feature</p>
    <h2 class="banner-title">Hello, I'm Kevin.</h2>
    <p class="banner-desc">
      From mountain trails to pixel-perfect interfaces, Kevin's debut album features tracks on
      UX craft, engineering philosophy, and the quiet joy of a good powder day.
    </p>
  </div>
</a>

<style>
  .featured-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 16px 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--bg-elevated), var(--bg));
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 0 16px 8px;
    transition: filter 0.15s;
  }

  .featured-banner:hover {
    filter: brightness(0.96);
  }

  .banner-art {
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .banner-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .banner-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .banner-title {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .banner-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .featured-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      border-radius: 0;
    }

    .banner-art {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .banner-title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
